{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（27日）上午10時55分，將軍澳隧道公路往將軍澳方向近寶康公園有3車相撞意外，包括私家車、輕型貨車和中型貨車，其中兩名司機分別感到頸痛和腰痛。救援人員在場為傷者檢查傷勢。</p><p>從網上影片可見，一輛綠色私家車車尾被撞至凹陷毀爛，車頭則插入前面泥頭車的貨斗下。警方正調查意外原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"私家車車尾嚴重毀，車頭插入泥頭車車斗底。（RubyCrocodile2455 / 將軍澳主場）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202963561089863680865012.jpeg/UE21oZUoDwg1q-rLaYI_jSS0XIEZpJj5EFyAihBcgIo\"/><figcaption>私家車車尾嚴重毀，車頭插入泥頭車車斗底。（RubyCrocodile2455 / 將軍澳主場）</figcaption></figure><p>因交通意外，將軍澳隧道公路（往將軍澳方向）近寶康公園的慢線一度封閉；將軍澳隧道（往將軍澳方向）亦一度實施間歇性封閉。其後解封及取消。</p><figure><img alt=\"將軍澳隧道公路有3車相撞，其中私家車車頭插在貨車車斗下。（Threads@rajput_asim1圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202957253515284480986073.png/10MGr-sTfI2dZOuvsr-WJGc7zEOf_Z86SiYoa0omKGs\"/><figcaption>將軍澳隧道公路有3車相撞，其中私家車車頭插在貨車車斗下。（Threads@rajput_asim1圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"將軍澳隧道公路有3車相撞。（Threads@rajput_asim1圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202957251095040000973561.png/eHVtDvbRjQebvuhv_LwdVx8vokKCDW_-sx1_6rMdf-o\"/><figcaption>將軍澳隧道公路有3車相撞。（Threads@rajput_asim1圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私家車被撞至凹陷。（Threads@rajput_asim1圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202958355392368640986541.png/sv-G-rY6A0BDLm5S-3cop8m7JKr_JiIAYoNa0WKDWtE\"/><figcaption>私家車被撞至凹陷。（Threads@rajput_asim1圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Threads@rajput_asim1圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202958785937674240680472.png/NpKZM-IzABTHvFyrI-D5JwlmAR35Tf9OVVQi2FVUItg\"/><figcaption>（Threads@rajput_asim1圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Threads@rajput_asim1圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202958789234528256516978.png/tVqSSZbMft4VWNldmCdtgFNMQW0Z6VgWudDNRbnQzUU\"/><figcaption>（Threads@rajput_asim1圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T05:23:57.490515+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":429,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:10:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:36.700773+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T05:17:31.594766+00:00","content_hash":"30a0d1849947c634e4f8ed73c07bacf783832e3d14bbc3c5c89f09a6f97bdfcb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}